      "content": "i get that but my surgeon is out of the office until tomorrow morning and i really just want to avoid the hospital if i can. if it's just some inflammation from the surgery, wouldn't like a higher dose of ibuprofen or maybe some aspirin help clear the swelling out? i'm just trying to manage the pain and the puffiness so i can get through the night.",
